So consider that too.

238
00:32:53,000 --> 00:33:00,000
So that's why in the real world there are no brain improvements and everything is brain efficient no matter how terrible.

239
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:05,000
And in this case you might be saying, well, why do we even go and study this concept?

240
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:08,000
Well, really it's pretty much only useful here.

241
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:12,000
And the other thing it's useful for is just to understand why it doesn't apply in the real world.

242
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:15,000
So I think there's insight there.

243
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Here's a concept which sounds good until you realize that it never matters in the real world.

244
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:26,000
And you may say, all right, well, now let's try to think of some efficiency concept that does matter in the real world.

245
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:30,000
And this brings us to counter-haze efficiency.

246
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:34,000
So whenever economists are actually doing policy analysis, they almost always switch this.

247
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:40,000
Counter-haze cost-benefit efficiency, they are for all types of purposes the same.

248
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:43,000
Counter-haze is sort of the more academic version.

249
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:46,000
Cost-benefit is what bureaucrats do.

250
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:51,000
And we're going to see sometimes they do it poorly, but still this is what we're trying to do.

251
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:58,000
So since your situation is counter-haze efficient, if and only if the dollar value of social resources is maximized,

252
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:04,000
or it could be the euro or the ruble or the yen, it doesn't matter.

253
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:10,000
And then a counter-haze improvement is any change that raises the dollar value of social resources.

254
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:15,000
By the way, there is one thing that I forgot to mention, which is, let's see, a couple of things.

255
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:20,000
So first of all, you have your absolute entitlement to attend that rank in the middle class.

